<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.label>FSF复杂工作</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.1.text>修改设置后需重启游戏。
若在已有存档中启用新的工作类型，现有机械体需要重新替换才能获得新工作类型。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.1.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.4.text>复杂工作设置</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.4.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.6.label>将异常研究相关工作归入黑暗研究</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.6.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.8.text>将其他工作类型中的Anomaly任务移入黑暗研究，并把社交能力纳入该工作类型的要求。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.8.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.11.label>征召时执行工作</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.11.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.13.text>允许征召状态下执行工作，无需反复取消征召和重新征召。
注意：少数任务仍可能无法在征召时执行，或会强制取消征召。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.13.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.16.label>灭火工作包含救援</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.16.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.18.text>为灭火工作添加救援任务，使执行灭火工作的角色先救援倒地友军，再灭火。
注意：虽然它可替代独立救援工作类型，但两项同时启用也没有问题。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.18.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.21.label>解除理念角色的工作及武器限制</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.21.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.23.text>移除所有理念角色禁用的工作类型和武器限制。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.23.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.26.label>允许机械体执行更多工作</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.26.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.28.text>将工作任务的canBeDoneByMechs由false改为true。
注意：部分任务缺少额外代码补丁时会破坏游戏，因此不包含这些任务。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.28.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.31.label>允许奴隶执行更多工作</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.31.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.33.text>允许奴隶执行除看守以外的全部工作类型。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.33.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.41.label>独立清除污染工作</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.41.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.43.text>将清除污染任务划分为独立工作类型。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.43.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.46.label>独立清雪工作</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.46.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.48.text>将清雪任务划分为独立工作类型。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.48.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.51.label>独立改信工作</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.51.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.53.text>将改信任务划分为独立工作类型。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.53.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.56.label>独立入侵工作</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.56.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.58.text>将全部入侵相关任务划分为独立工作类型。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.58.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.61.label>独立机械体工作</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.61.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.63.text>将全部机械体相关任务划分为独立工作类型。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.63.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.66.label>独立合并堆叠工作</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.66.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.68.text>将合并堆叠任务从搬运划分为独立工作类型。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.68.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.71.label>独立涂色工作</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.71.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.73.text>将全部涂色相关任务划分为独立工作类型。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.73.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.76.label>独立囚犯照料工作</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.76.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.78.text>将全部囚犯照料任务划分为独立工作类型。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.78.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.81.label>独立修剪工作</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.81.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.83.text>将全部修剪相关任务划分为独立工作类型。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.83.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.86.label>独立救援工作</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.86.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.88.text>添加专门救援倒地友军的独立工作类型。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.88.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.91.label>独立自我治疗工作</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.91.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.93.text>将全部自我治疗相关任务划分为独立工作类型。角色仍需开启自我治疗选项；此工作让角色能治疗自己而无需负责其他人的医疗工作。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.93.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.96.label>独立屠宰工作</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.96.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.98.text>将全部动物屠宰相关任务划分为独立工作类型。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.98.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.101.label>独立打磨工作</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.101.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.103.text>将全部表面打磨相关任务划分为独立工作类型。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.103.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.106.label>独立驯服工作</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.106.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.108.text>将全部动物驯服相关任务划分为独立工作类型。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.108.text>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.111.label>独立教学工作</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.111.label>
  <FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.113.text>将儿童教学任务从育儿划分为独立工作类型。</FrozenSnowFoxComplexJobsSettings.settings.113.text>
</LanguageData>